# Dart / Flutter conventions

- Follow the `AGENTS.md` in the subfolder you edit (`lib/services`, `controllers`, etc.).
- Register new GetX services/controllers in `lib/bindings/app_bindings.dart`.
- Services: no widgets. Controllers: orchestrate. Screens/widgets: UI only.
- Preserve OpenAI shapes in `LocalApiServerService` (`/v1/models`, `/v1/chat/completions` + stream).
- Don’t hand-edit Hive `*.g.dart`; use build_runner.
- Reuse `AppColors` / existing theme helpers.
